# The kit itself is NOT reformatted, and that is a decision with a reason.
# Prettier's rewrap of src/ingot changes ~30 component files without
# changing a line of behaviour, and the version guard would then demand a
# version bump on ~30 doc pages. A version that moves for a line break
# stops meaning "behaviour changed", which is the one thing the release
# automation stands on. The kit gets formatted with the next kit epoch (a
# `release!:` commit), where one version move covers the whole tree.
src/ingot

examples/*/dist/
examples/*/vendor/
examples/*/public/
